= Smart contract — Technical =

Smart-contract execution is deterministic with respect to the transaction input and visible execution state under the platform's semantics. Replicated nodes must derive the same state transition. External data therefore requires an oracle or another agreed input mechanism rather than arbitrary nondeterministic reads.

== Modeling / security cautions ==
* smart contract ≠ legal contract by definition
* smart contract ≠ automatically autonomous or secure
* on-chain execution ≠ knowledge of external facts

